# Sundial reads this one file: $SUNDIAL_HOME/.env (default ~/.sundial/.env).
# Keep it private (the installer creates it with mode 600).
#
# Everything here is OPTIONAL. Without an LLM, Sundial still records, folds and
# shows your day on the Today screen; Gnomon's chat and written summaries need
# a model.
#
# Any OpenAI-compatible chat-completions endpoint works. Pick ONE:
#
# A local model (nothing leaves this Mac) — e.g. Ollama:
# SUNDIAL_LLM_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:11434/v1
# SUNDIAL_LLM_MODEL=qwen3:8b
#
# A hosted API (sanitized text goes to that provider):
# SUNDIAL_LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# SUNDIAL_LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
# SUNDIAL_LLM_API_KEY=
#
# Restart after editing (from the repo folder):  node bin/sundial restart

# The phone ingest listener (127.0.0.1 only; reach it over Tailscale Serve).
# Off by default. The phone authenticates with $SUNDIAL_HOME/.daemon/api-token.
# SUNDIAL_PHONE_INGEST=1
